{"4038300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost In Your Eyes", "steam_appid": 4038300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think you and your friend can handle puzzles together? We would love to see you try! In our co-op puzzle game Lost In Your Eyes challenging puzzles where you need to brainstorm together awaits you! To see you have a strong bond and friendship, you need to communicate, trust and solve everything together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/4cfb03e34997808450925f856db1d02f.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/4cfb03e34997808450925f856db1d02f.webm?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/4cfb03e34997808450925f856db1d02f.mp4?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure you and your friend take on different tasks in different levels of...well no need to spoil it. Every soul wants to be free but our EYES see everything, in every area where you need to escape from a Cave, Labyrinth or a CIRCUS! Every theme has found their own challenge and wants you to work together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget, this will be a test for you and your friend! Do you trust each other enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/cd93479e6d773b10db78f5b4f1c61455.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/cd93479e6d773b10db78f5b4f1c61455.webm?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/cd93479e6d773b10db78f5b4f1c61455.mp4?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAMERA SWAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this mechanic, test your motor skills to see if you can walk without seeing through your own EYES. You and your friend need to help each other to get over some tests to take back your vision in some areas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Communicate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give every clue to each other...if you want to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/de475fe5b7fd285277b8b4605b1b30d9.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/de475fe5b7fd285277b8b4605b1b30d9.webm?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/de475fe5b7fd285277b8b4605b1b30d9.mp4?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One challenge, two Friends, same goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/f3c8bae437fcf5568555d738965e241e.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/f3c8bae437fcf5568555d738965e241e.webm?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/f3c8bae437fcf5568555d738965e241e.mp4?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELL? of an experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/dcff7b1f608336c69b2b7c358316b044.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/dcff7b1f608336c69b2b7c358316b044.webm?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/dcff7b1f608336c69b2b7c358316b044.mp4?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think you and your friend can handle puzzles together? We would love to see you try! In our co-op puzzle game Lost In Your Eyes challenging puzzles where you need to brainstorm together awaits you! To see you have a strong bond and friendship, you need to communicate, trust and solve everything together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/4cfb03e34997808450925f856db1d02f.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/4cfb03e34997808450925f856db1d02f.webm?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/4cfb03e34997808450925f856db1d02f.mp4?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure you and your friend take on different tasks in different levels of...well no need to spoil it. Every soul wants to be free but our EYES see everything, in every area where you need to escape from a Cave, Labyrinth or a CIRCUS! Every theme has found their own challenge and wants you to work together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget, this will be a test for you and your friend! Do you trust each other enough?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/cd93479e6d773b10db78f5b4f1c61455.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/cd93479e6d773b10db78f5b4f1c61455.webm?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/cd93479e6d773b10db78f5b4f1c61455.mp4?t=1787711244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAMERA SWAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this mechanic, test your motor skills to see if you can walk without seeing through your own EYES. You and your friend need to help each other to get over some tests to take back your vision in some areas!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Communicate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give every clue to each other...if you want to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/de475fe5b7fd285277b8b4605b1b30d9.poster.avif?t=1787711244\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038300/extras/de4